      ('hp-omnibook-16-by0015dx', NULL, 'https://support.hp.com/', 'Unverified - leave blank', 'Exact HP-hosted product description not verified; source model retained. The stock list reads "Ryzen 5 40" — the processor model number looks cut off; confirm it before publishing.'),
