      ('acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-42p-r917', 'Aspire AG15-42P', 'https://www.acer.com/es-es/support/product-support/Aspire_AG15-42P/downloads', 'Official title / model label only', 'Manufacturer model support; R917 configuration not confirmed.'),
